%% Decision Tree template — Visual Standards category 4
%% Use for Decision Table Testing, Boundary Value Analysis, State Transition Testing,
%% and any "which approach should I use" module.
%% Never render a decision tree as ASCII art in published content — Mermaid only.

flowchart TD
    A{Decision question?} -->|Condition A| B[Outcome A]
    A -->|Condition B| C{Second decision?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Outcome B]
    C -->|No| E[Outcome C]
